<title>USA: Fed says overnight system RPs added $5.626 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system RPs added $5.626 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's overnight system repurchase operation totaled $5.626 billion, a spokeswoman at the Federal Reserve Bank of New York confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
